<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description"
    content="구마모토 안전 여행 공식 포털 사이트입니다. 실시간 재해 경보, 화산 최신 정보, 의료 지원, 교통 접근 안내, 구마모토 관광 명소 정보를 제공하여 외국인 여행객이 안심하고 일본 구마모토를 여행할 수 있도록 돕습니다.">
  <title>구마모토 안전 여행 포털 | 공식 관광 및 방재 가이드</title>

  <!-- Google Web Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* =========================================
       Base & CSS Variables / デザインシステム
    ========================================= */
    :root {
      /* カラーパレット（熊本の自然と安心感を表現） */
      --c-green-dark: #143e26;
      --c-green-main: #246d3e;
      --c-green-accent: #2e8b57;
      --c-green-light: #f0f7f2;
      --c-blue-dark: #1e3a8a;
      --c-blue-main: #2563eb;
      --c-blue-light: #eff6ff;
      --c-red-main: #dc2626;
      --c-red-dark: #991b1b;
      --c-red-light: #fef2f2;
      --c-amber: #d97706;
      --c-amber-light: #fffbeb;
      --c-text-primary: #1e293b;
      --c-text-secondary: #475569;
      --c-text-muted: #64748b;
      --bg-body: #f8fafc;
      --bg-card: #ffffff;
      --border-color: #e2e8f0;
      --border-light: #f1f5f9;

      /* UI トークン */
      --radius-sm: 6px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-full: 9999px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 2px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      --shadow-lg: 0 12px 24px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12), 0 4px 8px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      --shadow-hover: 0 16px 32px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15), 0 6px 12px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--c-text-primary);
      background-color: var(--bg-body);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    h4,
    .font-heading {
      font-family: 'Outfit', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    /* =========================================
       SVG Icon Utilities / アイコン共通スタイル
    ========================================= */
    .svg-icon {
      width: 1.25rem;
      height: 1.25rem;
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: middle;
      fill: currentColor;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .svg-icon-stroke {
      width: 1.25rem;
      height: 1.25rem;
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: middle;
      fill: none;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* =========================================
       Hero Section / ヒーローヘッダー
    ========================================= */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      background-image: url('https://kumamoto.guide/files/dfb31094-8fe8-4dc0-a28c-221482526649_l.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 38%;
      padding: 100px 20px 90px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6) 0%, rgba(20, 62, 38, 0.75) 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(1px);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .hero-badge-pulse {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: #4ade80;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.4);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {

      0%,
      100% {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 1;
      }

      50% {
        transform: scale(1.2);
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .hero-title span {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a7f3d0 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-lead {
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-hero {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      color: #ffffff;
      transition: var(--transition);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .btn-hero svg {
      width: 1.35rem;
      height: 1.35rem;
    }

    .btn-hero:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    .btn-hero-green {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d6a4f 0%, #1b4332 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .btn-hero-green:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #388e3c 0%, #205739 100%);
    }

    .btn-hero-blue {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .btn-hero-blue:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #1e40af 100%);
    }

    /* =========================================
       Main Content Container
    ========================================= */
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-green-dark);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .section-title svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      color: var(--c-green-accent);
    }

    .section-title-sub {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* =========================================
       Explore Kumamoto Section / 観光ハイライト
    ========================================= */
    .explore-grid {
      --explore-cols: 5;
      --official-banner-w: 290px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--explore-cols), 1fr) var(--official-banner-w);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
    }

    .explore-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
    }

    .explore-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .explore-card-img-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .explore-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .explore-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.06);
    }

    .explore-card-body {
      padding: 14px 10px;
      flex-grow: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .explore-card-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--c-text-primary);
    }

    .explore-card-sub {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .official-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #eaf5ee 0%, #d8ecdf 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid #a3d9b3;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 24px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .official-banner:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e2f1e7 0%, #cee6d6 100%);
    }

    .official-banner-tag {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--c-green-main);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .official-banner h3 {
      color: var(--c-green-dark);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .btn-official {
      background: var(--c-green-dark);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: var(--transition);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(20, 62, 38, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-official:hover {
      background: var(--c-green-main);
      color: #ffffff;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    /* =========================================
       SNS Section (Follow Kumamoto)
    ========================================= */
    .sns-container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
    }

    .sns-card {
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .sns-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .sns-card-fb {
      border-left: 4px solid #1877f2;
    }

    .sns-card-ig {
      border-left: 4px solid #e1306c;
    }

    .sns-card-naver {
      border-left: 4px solid #03c75a;

    }
    .sns-card-naver .sns-handle {
      color: #03c75a;

    }
    .sns-icon-naver {
      color: #03c75a;
    }

    .sns-card-yt {
      border-left: 4px solid #ff0000;
    }

    .sns-card-x {
      border-left: 4px solid #0f172a;
    }

    .sns-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .sns-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--c-text-primary);
    }

    .sns-handle {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--c-blue-main);
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .sns-card-ig .sns-handle {
      color: #e1306c;
    }

    .sns-card-yt .sns-handle {
      color: #ff0000;
    }

    .sns-card-x .sns-handle {
      color: #334155;
    }

    .sns-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .sns-icon-fb {
      color: #1877f2;
    }

    .sns-icon-ig {
      color: #e1306c;
    }

    .sns-icon-yt {
      color: #ff0000;
    }

    .sns-icon-x {
      color: #0f172a;
    }



    /* =========================================
       3-Column Information Grid (Safety, Medical, Transport)
    ========================================= */
    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
    }

    .info-col {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      padding: 26px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .info-col:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .info-col-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .info-col-title span {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .info-title-safety {
      color: var(--c-blue-dark);
      border-bottom-color: #bfdbfe;
    }

    .info-title-medical {
      color: var(--c-red-dark);
      border-bottom-color: #fecaca;
    }

    .info-title-transport {
      color: var(--c-green-dark);
      border-bottom-color: #bbf7d0;
    }

    /* Cards inside columns */
    .info-card {
      background: var(--bg-body);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: block;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .info-card:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .info-card:hover {
      background: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .info-card-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--c-text-primary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .info-card-desc {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .info-list {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 18px;
      list-style: disc;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn-card-action {
      background: var(--c-blue-main);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .btn-card-action:hover {
      opacity: 0.92;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* Medical Customizations */
    .medical-card {
      background: #fff8f8;
      border-color: #fecdd3;
    }

    .medical-card:hover {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-color: #fda4af;
    }

    .btn-medical {
      background: var(--c-red-main);
    }

    .hotline-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff1f2 0%, #fee2e2 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid #fca5a5;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hotline-box h4 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-red-dark);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .hotline-box p {
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hotline-phone {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--c-red-main);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 9px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      transition: var(--transition);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
    }

    .hotline-phone:hover {
      background: var(--c-red-dark);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    .emergency-dial-mini {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .emergency-dial-btn {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      display: block;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .emergency-dial-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--c-red-main);
      background: #fff5f5;
    }

    .emergency-dial-num {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-red-main);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .emergency-dial-desc {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Transportation List */
    .transport-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .transport-list li a {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: var(--bg-body);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .transport-list li a:hover {
      color: var(--c-green-dark);
      border-color: #86efac;
      background: var(--c-green-light);
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .transport-list-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .transport-list-label svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      color: var(--c-green-main);
    }

    .transport-badge {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .transport-arrow {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .transport-list li a:hover .transport-arrow {
      color: var(--c-green-dark);
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    /* =========================================
       Emergency Bottom Banner / 緊急リソースバナー
    ========================================= */
    .emergency-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b91c1c 0%, #991b1b 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    .emergency-header {
      min-width: 200px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .emergency-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .emergency-header span {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 6px;
      display: block;
      color: #fecaca;
    }

    .emergency-items {
      display: flex;
      flex: 1;
      justify-content: space-around;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .em-item {
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      padding: 16px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-width: 140px;
      flex: 1;
      transition: var(--transition);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .em-item:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .em-item svg {
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      fill: #ffffff;
    }

    .em-item-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .em-item-sub {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #fecaca;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .em-item a {
      color: #ffffff;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* =========================================
       Footer / フッター
    ========================================= */
    footer {
      background: var(--c-green-dark);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 50px 24px 36px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 4px solid var(--c-green-accent);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .footer-group-title {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      color: #a7f3d0;
    }

    .footer-links ul {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 28px;
    }

    .footer-links ul li a {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      transition: var(--transition);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .footer-links ul li a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    /* =========================================
       Responsive Adjustments / レスポンシブ対応
    ========================================= */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .explore-grid {
        --explore-cols: 3;
        --official-banner-w: 1fr;
      }

      .official-banner {
        grid-column: span 3;
      }

      .sns-container {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 70px 16px 60px;
      }

      .explore-grid {
        --explore-cols: 2;
        --official-banner-w: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .official-banner {
        grid-column: span 2;
      }

      .emergency-banner {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px 18px;
      }

      .emergency-header {
        min-width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .emergency-items {
        width: 100%;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .em-item {
        min-width: auto;
      }

      .sns-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .emergency-items {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .footer-links ul {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

